	(text "9 V from the panel jack. D101 blocks reverse polarity, D102 and C101 tame the hot-plug transient\nthat locked the TLC5927s on v1. Two branches with their own polyfuse, so a fault on one leaves the other up:\n+9V_BL feeds the backlight, +9V_REG the MIC29302. 5V_EXT goes to the TPS2115A (logic) and to the\nannunciator anode switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "78bacf6f-1363-4dc6-ae41-523f8b0767ab")
	)
